{"4291550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pathways Lost: Reclaim", "steam_appid": 4291550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/2f50b7901319b5fcf679b60179abed26.poster.avif?t=1787344054\" aria-label=\"Units are being spawned on opposite sites. On the left is the player with his units and mech. Both sides clash in the middle and fight.\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/2f50b7901319b5fcf679b60179abed26.webm?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/2f50b7901319b5fcf679b60179abed26.mp4?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically deploy waves of specialised units that auto battle and fight without micromanagement. Balance your composition as they clash head-to-head with the enemy on the other side. Earn resources and use them between battles to unlock new devastating skills and powerful gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/fa2a4d9bc72ed926bef1e9d68f1377d2.poster.avif?t=1787344054\" aria-label=\"Command your Mech - A green mech slamming a huge hammer into an enemy army causing a massive explosion.\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/fa2a4d9bc72ed926bef1e9d68f1377d2.webm?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/fa2a4d9bc72ed926bef1e9d68f1377d2.mp4?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Control a powerful mech with devastating special abilities that can turn the tide of battle. Rain fire with orbital strikes, erect protective barriers or charge enemies with a force that shakes the battlefield. Your mech is the ultimate ace in the hole. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/715bcf26f14d8bf8f20dd3b1419338b0.poster.avif?t=1787344054\" aria-label=\"Customize your Units - Various units get a equiped with armor, weapons and ammunition.\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/715bcf26f14d8bf8f20dd3b1419338b0.webm?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/715bcf26f14d8bf8f20dd3b1419338b0.mp4?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip every soldier, mercenary and warrior with weapons, armor, tactical gear and ominous items to create devastating synergies. Beef up your units and let them wreak havoc on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/eea6490f9fff22d47c8946f6e18d647e.poster.avif?t=1787344054\" aria-label=\"Upgrade your Spaceship - A cut open space ship is shown and empty rooms are clicked and upgraded.\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/eea6490f9fff22d47c8946f6e18d647e.webm?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/eea6490f9fff22d47c8946f6e18d647e.mp4?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, return to your explorer spaceship where you buy legendary gear, unlock new skills from an expanding tech tree and prepare units for harder fights ahead. Every resource earned in combat fuels your ascent to overwhelming the threat to humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/27d94120d6d53fa767ce3ee30d9d77fa.poster.avif?t=1787344054\" aria-label=\"Discover the Galaxy - A star map is navigated interrupted by short sequences of fights on the respective planets. Shown are a water planet, a forest planet and a space platform biome.\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/27d94120d6d53fa767ce3ee30d9d77fa.webm?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/27d94120d6d53fa767ce3ee30d9d77fa.mp4?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across water planets, scorching deserts, frozen wastelands, space platforms and more. Each environment demands tactical adaptation and shifts how your units perform. Discover new worlds as you reclaim pathways through the dark matter sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/4ddc6b19ad163caf92ec677a9499f908.poster.avif?t=1787344054\" aria-label=\"Level Up Your Skills - You see various skills in a skill tree being unlocked\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/4ddc6b19ad163caf92ec677a9499f908.webm?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/4ddc6b19ad163caf92ec677a9499f908.mp4?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades and hard-earned unlocks shape your arsenal. But beware, should the main enemy force catch up with you... You might have to abandon your current timeline and start the run anew while only saving one of your units progression. Each run evolves your power as you push deeper into enemy territory, ensuring no two playthroughs feel identical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/3b809a801a05f55844ab85bdda9d4d70.poster.avif?t=1787344054\" aria-label=\"Wishlist Now\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/3b809a801a05f55844ab85bdda9d4d70.webm?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/3b809a801a05f55844ab85bdda9d4d70.mp4?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/2f50b7901319b5fcf679b60179abed26.poster.avif?t=1787344054\" aria-label=\"Units are being spawned on opposite sites. On the left is the player with his units and mech. Both sides clash in the middle and fight.\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4291550/extras/2f50b7901319b5fcf679b60179abed26.webm?t=1787344054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam